  ('system-reference-3', 'Tham chiếu hệ thống (sinh tự động)', 'Edge Functions', '## Edge Functions

| Function | Vai trò |
| --- | --- |
| _shared | (không có index.ts) |
| ai-assist | No service-role/database credential exists in this function. Model output is either a draft for human review or a validated plan for explicit read RPCs. |
| bank-webhook | Inbound transfers are authenticated before database access. The response is identical for matched/unmatched/replayed outcomes and contains no financial data. |
| manage-users | Secure administrative user management for Xe CRM. OWNER performs all account administration; MANAGER may only re-assign the |
| post-ai | Cà Rem AI Sales Assistant (post-ai). GEMINI_API_KEY chỉ tồn tại trong Edge Function Secrets; hàm KHÔNG có service-role key: mọi dữ liệu xe, bộ nhớ thương |
| process-message | Provider-agnostic outbox worker. V1 supports MOCK/DISABLED; V2 registers the official adapters (ZALO_OA, FB_MESSENGER, SMS) which fail closed WITHOUT credentials. |
| push-dispatch | push-dispatch — Edge Function gửi Web Push của Cà Rem (Phase 2.3). Bất kỳ ai gọi cũng chỉ có thể "rút hết việc của CHÍNH HỌ" (Bearer = JWT user) |
| reset-owner | Retired recovery endpoint. Recovery uses Supabase Auth or owner-authorized manage-users operations; this endpoint can no longer alter any account. |', 'STAFF', 'docs/SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md'),
  ('system-reference-4', 'Tham chiếu hệ thống (sinh tự động)', 'Bucket ảnh riêng tư', '## Bucket ảnh riêng tư

Khai báo `storage.buckets` trong migration; đường dẫn object luôn là `<uuid-chủ>/<uuid-ngẫu-nhiên>.<đuôi>` và trình duyệt chỉ xem qua signed URL ngắn hạn.

| Bucket | Chế độ | Giới hạn dung lượng | Định dạng |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| vehicle-images | riêng tư | 8 MB | image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif |
| identity-documents | riêng tư | 8 MB | image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif |', 'STAFF', 'docs/SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md'),
  ('project-state-preamble', 'Hiện trạng dự án', null, '# Project State — Xe CRM', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-1', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Hiện trạng được kiểm tra — 11/10/2026', '## Hiện trạng được kiểm tra — 11/10/2026

Mục này thay thế thông tin triển khai cũ phía dưới. LIVE Supabase có 70 migrations đến `20261011000100`; bốn Edge Functions manage-users/process-message/ai-assist/post-ai ACTIVE. Vercel production hiện ở commit `fb90144`, deployment `dpl_WqaswerTnbf2zciYYpC92pTSpiVX`, alias `xemaycarem.vercel.app`; Git production branch cấu hình là main dù artifact đang chạy từ integration branch đã được promote.

Các WIP mới gồm duyệt PLATE_AND_LAST5, contacts/message templates/bank reconciliation, Facebook extension và seasonal settings. Audit phát hiện và sửa lỗi privacy receipt/thông báo, webhook và delivery trust, lỗi mount form bán, clipboard caption+ảnh và phân trang duyệt. Sửa lỗi DB nằm ở forward `20261014000100`/`20261014000200`; docs dùng `20261014000300`. Migration nghỉ hưu nhắn tin `20261014000500` còn sót tham chiếu làm hỏng `check_user_can_hard_delete` và làm mất wrapper VietQR của `sell_vehicle`; cả hai sửa bằng forward-only `20261014001000_retire_messaging_followup.sql` (không DROP), kèm DB suite đã đồng bộ — xem `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Xem `docs/MASTER_RELEASE_AUDIT_20261011.md` để biết gate đã chạy và trạng thái release; không coi mục này là chứng nhận deploy.

Giá OWNER nhập PRIVATE, STAFF/MANAGER nhập PUBLIC, nguồn không xác định RESTRICTED. Provider chưa có credential báo NOT_CONFIGURED. Asset cinematic/theme tối chưa được OWNER duyệt; staging Auth/Storage chưa có cấu hình riêng. Kiểm thử local không chứng minh các mục đó.

Last reviewed: 2026-10-08', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-2', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Current result', '## Current result

Phase 1 customer communications is complete locally: completed sales enqueue an idempotent thank-you outbox item in the normal transaction; an outbox-write exception is isolated so it cannot fail the sale. Messaging settings default OFF, and CRM sale/customer views expose communication state/history. The `MessagingProvider` boundary supports MOCK only; an unconfigured mode safely skips. Local gates are recorded in `docs/VERIFICATION.md`. No hosted scheduler is installed, no provider secrets are in the frontend/tracked source, and this migration/function has not been deployed. Real delivery remains unverified.

The existing React/TypeScript/Vite PWA continues to use Supabase Auth, PostgreSQL RPC/RLS, Storage, and React Query. The current local implementation adds operational workflows and security changes on that architecture.

Operational additions include receivables collection, selected-day reconciliation, customer history, global search, CSV vehicle import, QR scan/search, safe customer receipts, mobile form conveniences, and an opt-in AI draft/read interface. Local automated verification is recorded in `docs/VERIFICATION.md`.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-3', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'AI copilot mode — 2026-10-01', '## AI copilot mode — 2026-10-01

A grounded shop assistant is complete locally. The sidebar section **TRỢ LÝ AI** (visible when `canOperate`) exposes `/copilot` (ask anything about the shop) and `/docs` (in-app documentation viewer). Migrations `20261001002800_knowledge_base.sql` and the generated `20261001002900_knowledge_seed.sql` add `public.knowledge_base` with tiered RLS (`private.knowledge_visible`) plus `search_knowledge`/`list_knowledge`/`get_knowledge_article`; `scripts/build-knowledge-seed.mjs` (`npm run knowledge:seed`) regenerates the seed from tracked markdown, and the seed file is never edited by hand. `ai-assist` gained `task: ''copilot''`: `copilot.ts` builds permission-scoped evidence from the existing read RPCs and document search under the caller JWT, and every fact or excerpt carries a citation id that deep-links to the screen showing it (`src/features/copilot/CitationLinks.tsx`, rendered through the allowlist-only `src/lib/markdownLite.tsx`). Deterministic retrieval is the default and works with no provider configuration; OWNER-only `mode: ''llm''` adds a RAG summary that must cite the retrieved evidence (`copilotSchema`/`validateGroundedAnswer`) and otherwise falls back with a warning. No write path exists. Local gates: `node scripts/check-edge-types.mjs` (six edge files), lint, typecheck, 252 vitest tests, and the PGLite database suite including the knowledge checks. The Playwright specs in `tests/e2e/copilot.spec.mjs` and any hosted deployment have not been run.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-4', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'UI feedback and system announcements — 2026-10-01', '## UI feedback and system announcements — 2026-10-01

A feedback and announcement polish layer is complete locally. Toasts (`src/lib/toast.ts` + `Toaster.tsx`) and a reusable confirm dialog (`src/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.tsx` exposing `confirmAction()`) are mounted app-wide with no new dependency; the last native `window.confirm` (unsaved-draft navigation guard) now uses `confirmAction()`. A persistent store-wide system announcement feature is added via migration `20261001002700_system_announcements.sql`: a dedicated `public.system_announcements` table, OWNER-only SECURITY DEFINER RPCs with RLS and `private.audit`, an app-shell `AnnouncementBar` (static/CSS-scrolling ticker, priority ordering, per-device dismissal, scheduling), and an OWNER manager under Cài đặt → Thông báo hệ thống. Local checks: typecheck passes, `tests/unit/feedback-notifications.test.ts` (3) passes, and the standalone operational DB suite reports 33 passing checks including 5 new announcement tests. This is not a hosted/production check; the migration has not been deployed.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-5', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Shorthand intake (/intake) — 2026-10-02', '## Shorthand intake (/intake) — 2026-10-02

Paste-a-phone-note vehicle intake is complete locally with no backend change. `src/lib/shorthand/` is a pure parsing layer: `vocabulary.ts` (diacritic/case-insensitive normalization plus brand/model/color/keyword aliases), `parseIntakeNotes.ts` (one entry per line; shorthand money `18tr5`/`1.2ty`/`450k`, odometer vạn `2v`, plates, dates, provenance tracking, per-line unknown tokens), `learnedDictionary.ts` (per-user abbreviation memory in device localStorage `carem_shorthand_dict_v1:<userId>`, 300-rule cap, injectable storage), and `intakeRows.ts` (client validation mirroring the server rules; import-row and single-draft mapping). `ShorthandIntakePage` at `/intake` (visible to `canOperate`) parses pasted notes into editable cards with autocomplete suggestions, teaches abbreviations from unknown-token chips and post-edit hints, validates against `validate_import_vehicles` first (server issues map onto the offending cards and block the dialog), then sends the whole list through one atomic `import_vehicles` call — never row-by-row writes. Purchase price is neither rendered nor sent for users without financial rights, mirroring `FINANCIAL_ACCESS_DENIED`/`PURCHASE_PRICE_REQUIRED`. Entry points: Acquisitions header, Capture card, and global search (Ctrl+K). Local gates on 02/10/2026: lint, typecheck, 304 vitest tests (21 new), regenerated knowledge seed (170 sections), the full DB suite, 4 new plus 74 total Playwright tests, the PWA gate, and the production build. The learned dictionary is per device/account and is not synced to the server; no migration or Edge Function changed.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-6', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'No forced first-login password change — 2026-10-02', '## No forced first-login password change — 2026-10-02

Per the shop owner''s request, newly created staff accounts sign straight into the app: the `manage-users` Edge Function `create` action no longer sets `must_change_password`, so the `/change-password` interstitial never appears for provisioning. Forward-only migration `20261002003500_no_forced_first_password_change.sql` releases accounts still gated by the old rule while keeping pending administrative resets (`reset_pending`) fail-closed, momentarily suspending `protect_last_usable_owner` around that single UPDATE. The mechanism remains active for the explicit OWNER action `reset_password` (the `force_password_change` action was later removed — see **Staff management** below), and staff who want a new password self-serve in Cài đặt → Đổi mật khẩu. Create-user dialog copy updated accordingly. Local gates: lint, typecheck, vitest, DB suite (migration replay on a disposable DB), regenerated knowledge seed.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-7', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Staff management: shared schedule, single owner, bounded ban — 2026-10-02', '## Staff management: shared schedule, single owner, bounded ban — 2026-10-02

The staff area was reworked per the shop owner''s request. The staff detail modal is fixed on mobile (bottom sheet fitting a 390×844 viewport, tabs **Quyền & Vai trò** / **Bảo mật & Trạng thái**, no horizontal overflow; Playwright asserts bounding box and `scrollWidth`). Per-account working hours were deleted as a concept: the profile columns `allowed_from/allowed_until/working_days` are legacy and no longer read for access, replaced by one shared schedule on `system_settings` (`staff_allowed_from/staff_allowed_until/staff_working_days`) applied to every non-OWNER role, overnight-window aware, Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh; OWNER-only to write via `save_settings` with server-side validation (`INVALID_SCHEDULE`). Account security offers exactly two modes: delete account (history kept; the final active OWNER cannot be deleted) and a bounded temporary ban (`disable` requires a future `disabledUntil`; presets Hết hôm nay / 7 ngày / 30 ngày / custom) — the require-new-password, unlimited lock, and old disable actions were removed and now return `INVALID_ACTION` from `manage-users`. Role hierarchy: exactly one active OWNER (raw second-owner writes hit `SINGLE_OWNER_REQUIRED`; promotion goes only through the atomic `transfer_ownership` RPC, serialized with `update_profile` on advisory lock 761482190, refusing self-transfer and inactive targets); MANAGER may change roles of juniors (STAFF) only; STAFF has no staff-management rights and `/users` moved to `access="manage"`. The "owner has the highest full control" wording was removed from the UI. Forward-only migration `20261002003600_shared_schedule_and_single_owner.sql` (renumbered from `003500` due to a version collision with the first-login migration) is APPLIED on production per the 2026-10-03 verified ledger. Local gates recorded in `docs/VERIFICATION.md`.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-8', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Copilot answering upgrade — 2026-10-06', '## Copilot answering upgrade — 2026-10-06

The deterministic copilot in `supabase/functions/ai-assist/copilot.ts` now answers a much wider slice of everyday Vietnamese questions while keeping the same read-only, caller-JWT grounding contract. Keyword patterns were broadened for every existing intent (e.g. "còn mấy xe", "thu về", "bán chạy", "khách nợ", "nhân viên", "thông tin cửa hàng") with word-boundary guards where bare substrings were unsafe (`nv`, `age`). Four new intents reuse existing server-gated read RPCs: **Tổng quan** (`tình hình/tóm tắt/ra sao` → dashboard headline figures), **Đơn bán gần đây** (`list_sales`, management-only, cites `/sales/:id`), **Đối soát trong ngày** (`daily_reconciliation`, management-only — the RPC''s own OWNER/MANAGER gate), **Khách hàng** (`list_customers`, total + most-frequent buyers, cites `/customers`), and the new `customer` citation type wired through `src/types` and `CitationLinks`. The plate/quote fallback was replaced by a grounded `global_search` entity lookup (plate, phone number, or quoted text) that cites matching vehicles, sales and customers, and it now also runs whenever an intent matched but produced no figure. `detectPeriod` understands `hôm nay`, `hôm qua`, `tuần này`, `tháng trước`, `quý N/quý này`, `năm nay/năm 2025` and combinations like `tháng 9 năm 2025`, all in Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh. `CopilotPage` gained suggested-question chips ("Tình hình cửa hàng hôm nay?", "Đơn bán gần đây?", "Thu tiền hôm nay ra sao?"). `docs/AI_ASSIST_CONTRACT.md` records the new retrieval steps. No write path, no schema change, no Edge deployment; gates recorded in `docs/VERIFICATION.md`.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-9', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Copilot draft-to-save handoff — 2026-10-06', '## Copilot draft-to-save handoff — 2026-10-06

The copilot now also turns a command sentence into a reviewable draft proposal, entirely client-side and provider-free. `src/lib/shorthand/draftActions.ts` parses inputs like "chi 500k thay nhớt xe 59-B1 123.45" (vehicle expense with shorthand money, plate validation through `@/lib/plate`, phone numbers never counted as amounts), "bán cho anh Bình 30tr xe 59-B1 123.45" (sale draft with customer/price) and purchase shorthand (handed to the existing `/intake` parser); interrogations are always rejected. `DraftActionCard` (rendered under the answer on `CopilotPage` and as the `/assist` voice fallback when the AI provider is unconfigured) resolves the plate through `list_vehicles` and only prefills the normal secure surfaces: `QuickExpenseModal` with the reviewed expense fields, `SellVehiclePage` via `location.state.aiDraft` (customer name/phone/price only, guarded defaults), and `ShorthandIntakePage` via `location.state.seedText` with one-time auto-parse. Expense proposals require `canManage`; sale/intake require `canOperate`. No RPC fires without the human pressing save in the existing forms — the read-only action wall is unchanged. Known incomplete path (documented, not silently shipped): when an expense plate does not resolve to a vehicle, `DraftActionCard` navigates to `/expenses` carrying `location.state.aiDraft`, but `ExpensePages` does not yet read that state, so that branch lands on the plain expenses screen without prefill (graceful degradation, no data loss; the resolved-vehicle path still opens `QuickExpenseModal` prefilled). See `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`. New gates in `tests/unit/copilot-draft-actions.test.tsx` (9 cases); contract documented in `docs/AI_ASSIST_CONTRACT.md`.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-10', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Release-candidate verification and local commit — 2026-10-06', '## Release-candidate verification and local commit — 2026-10-06

After the concurrent Copilot writer was confirmed stopped by process ownership (zero Codex/node/deno writer processes; newest dirty write frozen 17:31:13 across repeated watchdog samples; final Git status drift 0), the full 119-file workspace (64 modified + 55 untracked) was independently re-verified as one coherent snapshot and committed locally as a **single atomic commit** on `release/xe-crm-v1`.

Why one commit instead of the earlier C1–C4 split: `npm run knowledge:check` is a whole-tree generated-artifact gate — `build-system-docs.mjs` regenerates `docs/SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md` from every public RPC across the migration set, and `build-knowledge-seed.mjs` byte-compares the committed reseed migration to the regenerated corpus from the tracked markdown. Any intermediate commit that adds migrations (C1–C3) without the regenerated `SYSTEM_REFERENCE`/reseed (C4) is provably red, and fabricating intermediate reseed migrations would corrupt the real 42-applied/15-pending ledger. Combining the dependent changes into one atomic commit is the only structure where every commit passes all required CI checks (explicitly authorized by the commit instruction to prefer this over knowingly-broken intermediate commits). The `src/types/index.ts` mixed-hunk concern is therefore moot: `Profile.purged_at`, `Expense/Sale.updated_at`, and the `customer` citation type all land atomically with `CitationLinks`/`CopilotPage`, so no commit ever has a type/consumer mismatch (TS2741).

Full gate suite on the exact final tree, all green: `lint`, `typecheck`, `test` (372 unit / 36 files), `knowledge:check` (regenerated `SYSTEM_REFERENCE` + `20261006001400` reseed), `test:db` (30 checks), core integration (16), extension integration (22), `build`, `test:e2e` (112), `test:pwa` + `check-pwa-upgrade`. Migration ledger re-confirmed LIVE read-only: 42 applied / 15 pending / 0 divergent. No migration applied, no production change, no push, no deploy performed in this workspace. An external byte-exact checkpoint (secret-free, 0 restore mismatches) is retained at `carem-checkpoint-20261006`.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-11', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Staff deletion is immediate and permanent — 2026-10-08', '## Staff deletion is immediate and permanent — 2026-10-08

Per the shop owner''s instruction, the OWNER action **Xóa tài khoản** now removes the account from the system at once — no 30-day trash, no restore — while the work that staff recorded stays. `manage-users` `delete` branches on `check_user_can_hard_delete`: a history-free account is erased (profile row deleted, then `admin.auth.admin.deleteUser`, with profile rollback if Auth fails); an account with business history becomes a tombstone (`active=false`, `deleted_at`, `purged_at`, Auth password scrambled to a random string) so vehicles, sales, expenses, receipts, CCCD documents and audit rows remain attributable. `list_profiles` hides `deleted_at`/`purged_at` rows, so deleted accounts disappear from **Nhân sự**; `check_user_access` still returns `ACCOUNT_DELETED` and `enable_user` refuses a tombstone. The dead trash machinery was removed (`restore`, `hard_delete`, `purge`, `sweep`, `purgeOne`, `TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS`, the restore UI branch, and now-unreachable `deleted_at` conditions in `UsersPage`/`StaffSettingsModal`); `src/lib/api.ts` trims the action union and types the `outcome`. `check_user_can_hard_delete` was broadened from seven tables to every non-cascade reference to `profiles`, closing an FK-violation window mid-erase. Forward-only migration `20261008000100_staff_delete_permanent.sql` (LOCAL/PENDING, not deployed) redefines the two RPCs and re-comments `purged_at`. Local gates: handler unit suite (26, including the OWNER-target and tombstone branches and a `node:vm` sandbox that now supplies Web Crypto the way Deno does), failure + recovery-matrix units, DB `auth-security` suite on PGLite and PostgreSQL including a new tombstone check.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-12', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Vehicle field purge + "Loại xe" catalogue — 2026-10-08', '## Vehicle field purge + "Loại xe" catalogue — 2026-10-08

Per the shop owner''s decision, six specification fields are gone from the product permanently. Forward-only migration `20261008000300_vehicle_type_catalog_and_purge.sql` (LOCAL/PENDING, not deployed) drops `vehicles.brand`, `model`, `variant`, `engine_number`, `odometer` and `asking_price` with `CASCADE`, and replaces `model` with `vehicle_type_id uuid NOT NULL REFERENCES public.vehicle_types(id)`. No legacy value is mapped: every existing vehicle lands in the protected `Chưa phân loại` row and staff reclassify per record when they next open the file. The new `public.vehicle_types` catalogue (unique index on `lower(btrim(name))`, `CHECK char_length 2..60`, RLS `SELECT`-only for the client) is maintained by OWNER under Cài đặt → **Loại xe** through `save_vehicle_type`/`delete_vehicle_type` (`DUPLICATE_VEHICLE_TYPE`, `VEHICLE_TYPE_IN_USE`, `VEHICLE_TYPE_PROTECTED`), read by everyone active through `list_vehicle_types`, and adding a type needs no migration. Identity is now one shared helper on both sides: title **biển số · số khung** (`private.vehicle_label_text` / `src/lib/vehicleDisplay.ts`), subtitle **loại xe · đời · màu** (`private.vehicle_subtitle_text` / `vehicleSubtitle`), used by lists, detail, receipts, notifications, search, copilot and the public showroom. `sale_price` has no server-side source any more — it originates only from the Bán xe form, is never prefilled, and the public showroom shows no price at all (the customer "Định giá xe cần bán" field stays because `expected_price` is customer-declared). All rows in `audit_logs`, `vehicle_activity`, `notifications`, `customer_communications` and `message_outbox` are deleted (no tombstone), with the two immutability triggers suspended for that single statement; business and financial tables and the immutable `sale_financials` profit snapshot are untouched. Every read/write RPC that referenced a dropped column was rebuilt in the same migration, and the migration ends with a `DO` block that fails the transaction if a column, a history row, an untyped vehicle, the old index, or a `pg_proc` body still mentioning a purged field survives. Docs, the `ai-assist` contract (the `odometer` task is deleted; camera/voice/OCR return plate/frame/color/year only), the shorthand vocabulary (unknown tokens no longer fall into a model line), and the draft keys (`xe_crm_draft_v2`, `xe_crm_ux_v3`, deliberately invalidating old drafts) were updated in the same pass. `docs/VEHICLE_FIELD_PURGE_IMPACT.md` carries the dependency inventory, row-loss counts and the copies that cannot be erased.', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-13', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Below-cost sale approval + intake price typed by every role — 2026-10-09', '## Below-cost sale approval + intake price typed by every role — 2026-10-09

The intake cost became ordinary operational data: `private.acquire_vehicle_impl`, `private.save_vehicle_impl` and `public.validate_import_vehicles` require `purchase_price > 0` when a vehicle enters the stock (`PURCHASE_PRICE_REQUIRED`), an edit with the field omitted keeps the stored cost, and `private.vehicle_json` plus `public.list_acquisitions` return `purchase_price` **outside** the `private.can_financials()` branch while the aggregates built from it (`total_cost`, `expense_total`) stay financial-only. The "waiting for a cost" state now only describes rows that predate the rule (`cost_pending`, still blocked on sale with `PURCHASE_COST_REQUIRED`).

Selling at or above the intake price is unchanged. Selling below it is an OWNER decision wired into the **existing** approval queue rather than a parallel system: `private.sell_vehicle_impl` rejects non-OWNER below-cost attempts with `SALE_BELOW_COST_APPROVAL_REQUIRED` (42501); `public.request_sale_below_cost` (MANAGER/STAFF) inserts one `SALE_BELOW_COST` row into `public.approval_requests` with a server-generated payload — no `sales` row, the vehicle stays `IN_STOCK`, no revenue is recognized, and a partial unique index plus `ALREADY_PENDING` keep exactly one open request per vehicle; `public.resolve_sale_approval` (OWNER only) re-checks the live vehicle status, purchase price and expense snapshot against that payload (`APPROVAL_STALE_DATA`, `VEHICLE_NOT_AVAILABLE`, `DELETE_PENDING`) and then reuses `private.sell_vehicle_impl` in the same transaction with `sold_by` = the requester, while `REJECT` leaves the bike unsold and notifies the author; `public.cancel_sale_approval` lets the author (or OWNER) withdraw so a changed price can be re-submitted. An open request also blocks `sell_vehicle` (`SALE_APPROVAL_PENDING`, OWNER included) and the delete paths. Both new writes are receipt-wrapped (`private.operation_receipts` + `request_id`, reconciled through `public.get_operation_result`), preserving the double-save protocol.

The UI reuses what was already there: `/approvals` renders one `approval_requests` feed that branches on `kind` (delete request / below-cost sale) showing bike, plate, frame, intake price, proposed price, shortfall, requester and time; `SellVehiclePage` shows the shortfall warning and swaps its CTA to **Gửi yêu cầu duyệt** for non-OWNER users; `VehicleDetailPage` and `VehicleActionsSheet` surface `pending_sale_approval`; `NotificationBell`, `auditLabels` and `errors.ts` carry the four new actions and their Vietnamese guidance. Tests: `tests/db/below-cost-sale-approval.test.mjs` (registered in `scripts/test-db.mjs`), `tests/unit/below-cost-sale-approval.test.ts`, `tests/e2e/below-cost-sale-approval.spec.mjs`; the suites that encoded the old contract were updated (`shorthandIntake`, `validation`, `tests/db/auth-security`, e2e `shorthand-intake`, e2e `workflows`, e2e `assistant`, e2e `auth-failure-recovery`). Forward-only migration `20261010000300_below_cost_sale_approval.sql` is **LOCAL/PENDING** — not applied to production, not deployed, not committed. Gate results: `docs/VERIFICATION.md`, mục 2026-10-09 (cổng dành cho phạm vi này đều xanh; `npm run test:db` toàn run và `npm run build` hiện bị chặn bởi migration `20261010000600_ai_sales_assistant.sql` và `src/features/settings/PaymentSettingsCard.tsx` thuộc nhánh WIP song song).', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
  ('project-state-14', 'Hiện trạng dự án', 'Vehicle-post studio + Facebook hand-off — 2026-10-11', '## Vehicle-post studio + Facebook hand-off — 2026-10-11

Per the shop owner''s request the posting tool left the **TRỢ LÝ AI** accordion and became its own sidebar item **Đăng bài từ kho xe** (`/posts`, `canOperate`), rebuilt as a two-step flow with the create button at the bottom of the flow instead of beside the title. Step 1 does not duplicate the inventory list: **Chọn xe từ Kho** navigates to the real `/vehicles?pick=post&return=/posts`, and `InventoryPage` in pick mode renders only **Chọn** / **Xem chi tiết** (business filters, the cost column and every row action are suppressed under `pick=post`), then returns the chosen row through React Router `state.pickedVehicle`; the studio consumes it once and immediately `replace`s the URL with `state: null` so a later refresh cannot silently re-pick a vehicle. `IN_STOCK` preselects a sale/promo post kind, `SOLD` preselects **Xe vừa bán** (thank-you / sold / marketing style copy). Step 2 is a free-text brief: the user writes what kind of post they want, and `PostStudioPage` sends that brief **verbatim** (up to 600 chars, emoji and newlines intact) to the `post-ai` Edge Function, which treats it as untrusted *data* in `contents[0]` — never in `systemInstruction` — so the persona/guardrail layer still strips prices, personal phones, links and CCCD numbers; `scanPublicText` rejects with `BRIEF_NOT_PUBLIC_SAFE` and `log_post_ai_usage` records BLOCKED. `src/features/poststudio/briefSignals.ts` is a UI-only early warning that mirrors the server''s rules including the `PUBLIC_HOTLINE_DIGITS` whitelist, and the suggestion chips live in `briefSuggestions.ts` under a unit test that proves no chip can trip the server guard. Results render inside `FacebookPostCard` (Facebook-shaped composer preview: shop name, editable caption body, vehicle photos) and the pending-draft list uses the same card with a status badge plus **Xác nhận & chuyển vào Facebook**.

The hand-off is `src/lib/fbShare/` (`protocol` → `detect` → `images` → `bridge` → `strategies` → `status` → `service`) with three strategies and an explicit 10-stage state machine: `EXTENSION` (MV3 browser bridge in `extension/carem-fb-share/`, packed to `public/carem-fb-extension.zip` by `npm run fb:pack` on `prebuild`) fills the composer and **reads it back** before CRM is allowed to say anything; `NATIVE` uses `navigator.share`/`canShare({files})` on phones, with images primed into memory before the tap so the share sheet still has user activation; `MANUAL` copies the caption, opens Facebook and offers image download. A strategy only ever reports up to `READY_FOR_REVIEW`/`PARTIAL_SUCCESS`/`FALLBACK_REQUIRED`/`CANCELLED`/`FAILED`, and no path clicks or claims **Đăng** — `captionFilled` is only ever true from `EXTENSION`. Images are held in memory only for the current request (no localStorage persistence).

Local gates on 11/10/2026: `lint`, `typecheck`, `vitest` (739 tests / 63 files, incl. `tests/unit/fb-share.test.ts` 33 and `tests/unit/brief-signals.test.ts` 8), `knowledge:check`, `build` (+PWA generateSW, the extension zip present in `dist`), `node scripts/check-edge-types.mjs`, and the new `tests/e2e/post-studio-share.spec.mjs` (7/7, mocked Supabase, MANUAL branch proven by reading the clipboard back). NOT done: `supabase functions deploy post-ai` (blocked until OWNER GO per `docs/R2_FINAL_GO_NO_GO.md` §8 — the function is still MISSING in production, so the verbatim-brief contract is local-only), and any real-Facebook verification of the extension composer adapter or a phone share sheet (see `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`).', 'STAFF', 'docs/PROJECT_STATE.md'),
