- Hosted Auth session behavior, RLS, Storage, and endpoint configuration were verified read-only 2026-10-02/03 (ledger, config diff, functions list, live Vercel smoke); actual Edge Function request behavior remains locally tested only.
- `manage-users` is deployed ACTIVE (v10, 2026-10-02), but the users-module refactor committed later (`4cc3ff9`) may not match the deployed build; its runtime behavior (Deno resolution, CORS, authenticated OWNER flow, STAFF denial, `must_change_password` semantics assumed by migration 035) needs hosted testing before being claimed healthy.
