- Database and Storage recovery must be considered together. Before schema changes, verify the Supabase plan''s backup/PITR and retention in the live Dashboard, record a usable checkpoint, and document the forward recovery for each reviewed migration. Do not invent down migrations for destructive data changes.', 'OWNER', 'docs/PRODUCTION_RELEASE.md'),
  ('production-release-6', 'Phát hành production', 'Edge Function inventory', '## Edge Function inventory

