  ('agent-handoff-2', 'Bàn giao cho agent', 'Đăng bài từ kho xe + Smart Facebook Share — 2026-10-11', '## Đăng bài từ kho xe + Smart Facebook Share — 2026-10-11

Scope: the posting tool became a first-class sidebar surface (**Đăng bài từ kho xe**, `/posts`) with a two-step wizard, and a real hand-off path into Facebook. Decisions and rationale are in `docs/DECISIONS.md` ("Đăng bài từ kho xe + Cầu đăng Facebook — 11/10/2026"); verification limits are in `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md` ("Post Studio → Facebook hand-off"). Read both before touching this area.

- **Client**: `src/features/poststudio/PostStudioPage.tsx` (step 1 pick → step 2 free-text brief → FB-styled preview + drafts), `FacebookPostCard.tsx`, `FacebookShareButton.tsx` (button + honest status + setup guide), `briefSignals.ts` (server mirror incl. hotline whitelist), `briefSuggestions.ts`, `src/styles-poststudio.css`. `src/layouts/AppLayout.tsx` carries the new nav item outside the `#ai-nav-links` accordion. `src/features/vehicles/InventoryPage.tsx` gained `pick=post` selection mode (`?return=` round trip, only **Chọn**/**Xem chi tiết**). `src/lib/postStudioApi.ts` sends `brief` verbatim.
- **Hand-off layer**: `src/lib/fbShare/{protocol,detect,images,bridge,strategies,status,service}.ts` — three strategies (`EXTENSION` → `NATIVE` → `MANUAL`), ten stages, memory-only image cache, payload gate (5000 chars / 8 images / 4 MB each / 12 MB total), protocol version 1 on channel `carem-fb-share`.
- **Browser extension**: `extension/carem-fb-share/{manifest.json,background.js,content.js,README.md}` (MV3, public `key` → fixed ID `njlnpebadapfckldkmdhdhbmnmckgcap`, `externally_connectable` limited to the Cà Rem sites + dev origins, no cookies/tokens, verifies by read-back, never clicks **Đăng**). `npm run fb:pack` (wired into `predev`/`prebuild`) writes the Git-ignored `public/carem-fb-extension.zip` that the in-app guide links, so CI ships the same bytes as the source.
- **Edge**: `supabase/functions/post-ai/{index.ts,contracts.ts}` now accepts `brief` (≤600 chars) as user **data** in `contents[0]`, never in `systemInstruction`; `scanPublicText` flags `URL/CCCD/PHONE/MONEY/FINANCIAL_TERM` → `BRIEF_NOT_PUBLIC_SAFE` + `log_post_ai_usage` `BLOCKED`. Client falls back to `captionTemplates.ts` when the function is off/quota/error.
- **Tests**: `tests/unit/fb-share.test.ts` (33), `tests/unit/brief-signals.test.ts` (8), `tests/security/post-ai.test.ts` (18, incl. the structural brief/prompt separation), `tests/e2e/post-studio-share.spec.mjs` (7).
- **Gate status 2026-10-11**: `lint` ✅, `typecheck` ✅, `vitest` 739/63 files ✅, `knowledge:check` ✅ (after `npm run knowledge:seed`; the regenerated `docs/SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md` + `20261006001400` reseed also carry concurrent agents'' RPCs — bank reconciliation, seasonal theme, message templates), `build` + PWA ✅, `check-edge-types.mjs` ✅, new e2e spec 7/7 ✅. `npm run test:db` ❌ at HEAD `fb90144` on the sale check (`SALE_OWNER_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED`, financial-privacy lane) — pre-existing and unrelated.
- **Not done**: `supabase functions deploy post-ai` (blocked until OWNER GO, §8 of `docs/R2_FINAL_GO_NO_GO.md`; secrets `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `POST_AI_ENABLED`, `GEMINI_MODEL`), no commit/push performed, and **zero real-Facebook or real-device verification** — the composer adapter and the mobile share sheet both need a human machine. The extension is `Load unpacked` only (Chrome will not sideload from an internal site), so it is an internal rollout, not a store release.', 'OWNER', 'docs/AGENT_HANDOFF.md'),
  ('agent-handoff-3', 'Bàn giao cho agent', 'Vehicle field purge + "Loại xe" catalogue — 2026-10-08', '## Vehicle field purge + "Loại xe" catalogue — 2026-10-08

Scope: six vehicle specification fields are removed from the product permanently and the free-text **Dòng xe** becomes a governed **Loại xe** catalogue. Decisions, impact counts and the destructive-apply protocol live in `docs/VEHICLE_FIELD_PURGE_IMPACT.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md` (section dated 08/10/2026) and `docs/PRODUCTION_RELEASE.md` ("Pending destructive migration"). Read those before touching this area.

- **Server**: forward-only `supabase/migrations/20261008000300_vehicle_type_catalog_and_purge.sql` — new `public.vehicle_types` + `list_vehicle_types`/`save_vehicle_type`/`delete_vehicle_type`, history wipe (`audit_logs`, `vehicle_activity`, `notifications`, `customer_communications`, `message_outbox`), `DROP COLUMN brand, model, variant, engine_number, odometer, asking_price CASCADE` + `system_settings.quickpick_brands/quickpick_models`, and a rebuild of every dependent RPC (`private.vehicle_label_text`/`vehicle_subtitle_text`, `save_vehicle`, `acquire_vehicle`, `create_vehicle`, `import_vehicles`, `validate_import_vehicles`, `list_vehicles`, `get_vehicle`, `list_acquisitions`, `list_receivables`, `list_customers`, `get_customer_history`, `daily_reconciliation`, `dashboard`, `global_search`, `list_showroom_vehicles`, `sell_vehicle`, `get_settings`/`save_settings`, the notification trigger). It closes with `PURGE_ASSERT_FAILED` guards, so a half-applied migration aborts rather than leaving a broken schema.
- **Client**: `src/lib/vehicleDisplay.ts` is the single identity source (`vehicleTitle` = biển số · số khung, `vehicleSubtitle` = loại xe · đời · màu); every screen, receipt, alt text and aria-label goes through it. Settings tab QUICKPICK is now the OWNER-only **Loại xe** catalogue editor. Shorthand/OCR/camera no longer read or emit engine number, odometer, brand, variant or asking price; the "unknown token falls into Dòng xe" rule is deleted and unknown tokens only become chips. `sale_price`/`initial_payment` on the sell form start empty (`Number.NaN`) with no prefill from any source.
- **Edge**: `ai-assist` contract lost the `odometer` task entirely and every vehicle extraction now returns `frame_number, license_plate, color, year` only; `copilot.ts` labels and facts use the new identity; `process-message` templates carry no commercial vehicle name.
- **Ledger observed 2026-10-08** (`supabase migration list --linked`, read-only): 57 applied through `20261006001400`, 3 local/pending (`20261008000100`, `20261008000200`, `20261008000300`), 0 divergent. This **contradicts** the 2026-10-06 record in this file (42 applied / 15 pending): 15 versions that were pending then are applied now, and nothing in this workspace pushed them. Reconcile who applied them and with what dump before any further hosted write — do not assume the earlier ledger snapshot still holds.
- **Not yet done**: the local gate suite as a whole (`npm run check`, `test:e2e`, `test:pwa`, migration-chain replay on a disposable DB) and every hosted step. Local Supabase/Docker was not running during implementation, so `npm run test:db` and `db reset` replay results are outstanding; Deno is absent, so `scripts/check-edge-native.mjs` cannot run (`spawn deno ENOENT`) — install Deno or run that check in CI before deploying `ai-assist`/`process-message`.
